   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Trade-offs to raise\n\u2022 Cold start = weight load: minutes for 70B+\n\u2022 Keep warm floor for popular models\n\u2022 Scale on queue/KV pressure, not CPU\n\u2022 Bin-pack small models; tensor-parallel big ones\n\u2022 Spot / partner capacity can vanish: drain + retry\n\u2022 Cost per million tokens is the target metric",
   "originalText": "Trade-offs to raise\n\u2022 Cold start = weight load: minutes for 70B+\n\u2022 Keep warm floor for popular models\n\u2022 Scale on queue/KV pressure, not CPU\n\u2022 Bin-pack small models; tensor-parallel big ones\n\u2022 Spot / partner capacity can vanish: drain + retry\n\u2022 Cost per million tokens is the target metric",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
